msgstr "Lokal statistik"

#. Error state on linux: URnetwork wrote the system location file and can no longer remove it, so the machine may still be reporting a provider's location. Gives the user the recovery steps.
msgctxt "location_override_cleanup_required"
msgid "URnetwork could not remove the system location file, so this machine may still report a provider's location. Start the URnetwork system service and turn this off, or remove /etc/geolocation as an administrator."
msgstr "URnetwork kunde inte ta bort systemets platsfil, så den här datorn kan fortfarande rapportera en leverantörs plats. Starta systemtjänsten URnetwork och stäng av detta, eller ta bort /etc/geolocation som administratör."

#. Setup guide and info popup on linux: the honest limits of the device location override. Paired with location_override_coverage_geoclue.
msgctxt "location_override_coverage_gaps"
msgid "It does not cover everything. Chrome and KDE Plasma never ask GeoClue, and any app that works out your location from your IP address on its own is unaffected. Firefox falls back to its own lookup if the system does not answer quickly."
msgstr "Det täcker inte allt. Chrome och KDE Plasma frågar aldrig GeoClue, och appar som själva räknar ut din plats utifrån din IP-adress påverkas inte. Firefox faller tillbaka på sin egen uppslagning om systemet inte svarar snabbt."

#. Setup guide and info popup on linux: what the device location override actually covers. Shown alongside location_override_coverage_gaps, which states the limits.
msgctxt "location_override_coverage_geoclue"
msgid "Apps that ask the system for your location through GeoClue — including GNOME Settings and Maps, Firefox, and sandboxed Flatpak and Snap apps — report the provider's location instead of yours."
msgstr "Appar som frågar systemet om din plats via GeoClue — bland annat GNOME Inställningar och Kartor, Firefox samt sandlådade Flatpak- och Snap-appar — rapporterar leverantörens plats i stället för din."

#. Setup guide state on linux: every prerequisite for the device location override is met.
msgctxt "location_override_ready"
msgid "Ready. Turn on the toggle to report the connected provider's location as this machine's location."
msgstr "Klart. Slå på reglaget för att rapportera den anslutna leverantörens plats som den här datorns plats."

#. Setup guide step on linux: the GeoClue version requirement for the device location override.
msgctxt "location_override_step_geoclue"
msgid "Install GeoClue 2.7 or newer. It is not on every system, and Ubuntu 22.04 and Debian 12 ship an older version that cannot do this."
msgstr "Installera GeoClue 2.7 eller senare. Det finns inte på alla system, och Ubuntu 22.04 och Debian 12 levererar en äldre version som inte klarar detta."

#. Setup guide step on linux: the privileged helper needed to write the system location file. Reassures the user that the app itself never needs root.
msgctxt "location_override_step_service"
msgid "Install the URnetwork system service. The system location file lives under /etc, so a privileged helper has to write it — URnetwork never asks you to run the app itself as an administrator."
msgstr "Installera systemtjänsten URnetwork. Systemets platsfil ligger under /etc, så en privilegierad hjälpprocess måste skriva den — URnetwork ber dig aldrig köra själva appen som administratör."

#. Setup guide step on linux: keep GeoClue's static location source enabled so the override is read.
msgctxt "location_override_step_static_source"
msgid "Keep GeoClue's static location source enabled. It is on by default; check /etc/geoclue/geoclue.conf if you have changed it."
msgstr "Låt GeoClues statiska platskälla vara aktiverad. Den är på som standard; kontrollera /etc/geoclue/geoclue.conf om du har ändrat den."

